### Key Diagnostic Features Built Into This Pipeline

* **Independent vs. Sequential Cleaning Audit (Cell 3):** Distinguishes rows flagged by multiple rules simultaneously (e.g., a `9xx` part that also has `Quantity = 0.0`) from the net sequential drop, alongside a regional retention table to verify no single `Region Id` is disproportionately wiped out by missing `Bulk Value` or `Business Segment Description` entries.
* **Complete Year-Iteration Exhaustiveness (Cell 5):** Dynamically captures every observed combination across `{2022, 2023, 2024, 2025}` (`2023 Only`, `2024 Only`, `2025 Only`, `2022 - 2023 - 2024 - 2025`, `2023 - 2024 - 2025`, plus intermittent gap cohorts like `2023 - 2025`) together with `Active_In_Q4_2025` recency counts so discontinued SKUs with multi-year history are not mistakenly fed into active 2026 forecast pipelines.
* **Demand Pattern Classification (Cell 5):** Computes `ADI` (Average Demand Interval) and `CV` (Coefficient of Variation) per `Part Name + Region Id` inside `8_SKU_Region_Master_List`, allowing immediate separation of smooth/erratic series from intermittent series when selecting your forecasting models.
